1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,921
Every evening, in classrooms
with the lights off,

2
00:00:02,921 --> 00:00:07,690
the air conditioners keep running. No one
turns them off, and no one even knows.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,525
The school pays for cooling empty rooms,

4
00:00:10,525 --> 00:00:14,250
while lecturers have to borrow
a remote before every class.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,202
Introducing Nhat Vuong Controller:

6
00:00:18,202 --> 00:00:21,828
control every air conditioner
on campus from your phone,

7
00:00:21,828 --> 00:00:23,770
following the class timetable.

8
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,290
Teach in a room, and you can switch on its
air conditioner. No sign-up, no remote.

9
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:35,198
When the last class ends, the
system switches off by itself.

10
00:00:35,198 --> 00:00:37,650
Before class starts, the
room is already cool.

11
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,897
When a unit fails, maintenance
is alerted instantly,

12
00:00:43,897 --> 00:00:46,370
with the error code and the room.

13
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:52,206
No internet? The app still
works over the local network,

14
00:00:52,206 --> 00:00:54,610
protected by digital signatures.

15
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:03,690
27 features done, 111 automated
tests, running on Android and Windows.

16
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:07,230
Next step: a pilot in one campus building.

17
00:01:07,230 --> 00:01:11,690
Join us in turning every
classroom into a smart classroom.

18
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:16,610
Nhat Vuong Controller. Cool when
you need it, off when you don't.
